#. module: ai
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai.ir_actions_server_create_records
msgid ""
"Create records\n"
"        This tool is used to create new records in the database. It exposes "
"three main parameters:\n"
"            - explanation: A message to explain the tool call with a "
"question asking for user's CONFIRMATION.\n"
"            - model_name: the technical name of the model to create records "
"for\n"
"            - preview_menu_id: the id of a menu to be used to generate a "
"link (used in multiple records creation only)\n"
"            - values: the list of records to create with their fields values."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງແຖວຂໍ້ມູນ\n"
"        ເຄື່ອງມືນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງແຖວຂໍ້ມູນໃໝ່ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ. ມັນມີ 3 ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຫຼັກ:\n"
"            - explanation: ຂໍ້ຄວາມອະທິບາຍການຮຽກໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື ພ້ອມຄຳຖາມຂໍການຢືນຢັນຈາກຜູ້ໃຊ້.\n"
"            - model_name: ຊື່ເຕັກນິກຂອງໂມເດວທີ່ຈະສ້າງແຖວຂໍ້ມູນ\n"
"            - preview_menu_id: ລະຫັດເມນູທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສ້າງລິ້ງ (ໃຊ້ສະເພາະການສ້າງຫຼາຍແຖວຂໍ້ມູນ)\n"
"            - values: ລາຍການແຖວຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈະສ້າງພ້ອມຄ່າຂອງຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນຕ່າງໆ."

